  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Church promoting good governance in Southern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to provide capacity to Inter-Regional Meeting of Bishops of Southern Africa in order for the bishops to lobby and advocate for policies that promote good governance in the region. The idea is to amplify the Church voice on economic justice and good governance issues affecting men and women of Southern Africa. The Church through the project also seeks greater involvement of women in Church and civic issues affecting their societies. The idea is to see a greater number of women involved and appointed to influential positions in Church, civil society and politics.</narrative>
  </description>
